  "Look at what your {piece} can achieve.": "Mira lo que puede hacer {piece|your}.",
  "The critical square is {square}.": "La casilla crítica es {square}.",
  "Aim for {square} — that is where the magic happens.": "Apunta a {square} — ahí ocurre la magia.",
